  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:102924",
  "description": "The GNOME Display Manager (GDM) provides the graphical login screen. The screen is shown shortly after boot, after log out, and when switching the current user.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gdm: Missing authorization on CreateRemoteDisplay allows autologin as arbitrary users, including root (CVE-2026-132858)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Make smartcard method default when smartcad is inserted in login screen (gdm) (JIRA:RHEL-287797)\n  * Unable to switch users with smartcards with virtual terminals disabled (AlmaLinux-10) (JIRA:RHEL-307213)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
  "fromstr": "packager@almalinux.org",
